            "source_call_id": "toolu_015TgQ8i8kRH6W1kBXessT5T",
            "content": "# HF-2291: session-cache key length\n\nSeverity: high. Opened 2026-09-13 by the platform team.\n\nPLAT-3307, first shipped on `release/4.1`, derives session-cache keys from the full request path. Paths\nlonger than the cache's key limit make the cache reject the write, and the session is rebuilt on every\nrequest. The fix caps the key length.\n\n## Affected branches\n\n`release/4.1`, `release/4.2` and `release/4.3`. `release/4.0` predates PLAT-3307 and is not affected.\n\n## Affected services\n\nOnly services that load the session-cache module: `admin-console`, `cart-api`, `checkout-svc`, `loyalty-svc`, `profile-api`, `reco-engine`, `session-gw`, `webhooks-out`. Other services are not affected on any\nbranch.\n\n## Commit to deploy per branch\n\n| Branch | Commit |\n|---|---|\n| `release/4.1` | `1f173c77146512bfefba55286add284660a2131a` |\n| `release/4.2` | `aec3b0ea46ea3084bc7d1416d2ced4bd242c9c56` |\n| `release/4.3` | `2a2a83faf9a6d8e99a1dd6739ab65b168030701f` |\n\nThe changelog of each release branch is in `/app/hotfix/changelog/`, one file per branch, newest commit\nfirst. A branch's changelog lists the commits made on it since it was cut.\nrelease-4.0.txt\nrelease-4.1.txt\nrelease-4.2.txt\nrelease-4.3.txt\n==> /app/hotfix/changelog/release-4.0.txt <==\n# release/4.0, newest first: commit, date, subject\n7b6cdc1a9284e4e32850750d180e9ac6a594c44d 2026-08-02 PLAT-3153: add tracing to the outbound pool\na47d55a10b941788394bf0df7dd0d97bb61ad319 2026-07-30 PLAT-3377: drop the legacy v1 route\nddc9b3207e256171fd0ed2a72d582649f27bec1e 2026-07-27 PLAT-3087: log upstream latency\ne720b9bf384c1317c957a7ca6f074359a4bbabc9 2026-07-24 PLAT-3190: log session-cache evictions\ne1ec855ecb64b7e69ab98850bae7bd1394867ed1 2026-07-21 PLAT-3371: fix flaky clock test\nd6dc46b9f9b19ee6aa6db1930ceea68e87074374 2026-07-18 PLAT-3439: add tracing to the outbound pool\na3e51bec050c13b87ef8f4961754ffa1eb5a972b 2026-07-15 PLAT-3175: pin openssl\n8b0dddb4038222950133d0ba83d2d7b0931c7ab3 2026-07-12 PLAT-3438: rename internal metrics\n343af78bbbc4a713ad376545a60aa3cf47e35c4a 2026-07-09 PLAT-3127: raise worker pool size\n3b9ccfd77f907c9efb20a0e311bae5c5b3b49758 2026-07-06 PLAT-3344: drop the legacy v1 route\n\n==> /app/hotfix/changelog/release-4.1.txt <==\n# release/4.1, newest first: commit, date, subject\n1f173c77146512bfefba55286add284660a2131a 2026-08-26 HF-2291: cap session-cache key length (backport to 4.1)\ndf4ae0dae04716858d57b4e42ce618f5c5285998 2026-08-23 PLAT-3439: trim debug logging\n57192db11beb889355c99e5fc7b81874c255da54 2026-08-20 PLAT-3004: add tracing to the outbound pool\n8d81b0a5e7943f3c190764af22e0f7d074f1622c 2026-08-17 PLAT-3488: tighten request body limits\n1db0b260a8711a437bbc1fc9e8673a6fca0b03e3 2026-08-14 PLAT-3247: fix flaky clock test\n9b325a8d173c73785dc8e07cd309aca7debb290e 2026-08-11 PLAT-3427: trim debug logging\nc45e5e73d29fc532cda938065b68ddafee362916 2026-08-08 PLAT-3410: raise worker pool size\n9a0ac7c803b7b27479834f43fd0efbe3b7deaf76 2026-08-05 PLAT-3022: handle empty pagination cursor\n5f3b21b5a33129bec33d3aa024e1df4f9e20cb2a 2026-08-02 PLAT-3307: derive session-cache keys from the request path\na29ea7b1171908a4842cbc6a90374035e54c0cdc 2026-07-30 PLAT-3033: drop the legacy v1 route\n\n==> /app/hotfix/changelog/release-4.2.txt <==\n# release/4.2, newest first: commit, date, subject\n644e0a713a40f21d08fa75a61735f14c37cfeb62 2026-09-01 PLAT-3449: fix typo in config schema\n5852c7fdbb60a15f0fe304b874df10fece7c2cfc 2026-08-30 PLAT-3412: export session-cache hit ratio\n91bc1c9da9e29a8583bc2896813bbbcc1ec340a0 2026-08-28 PLAT-3374: bump grpc client to 1.64\naec3b0ea46ea3084bc7d1416d2ced4bd242c9c56 2026-08-26 HF-2291: cap session-cache key length (backport to 4.2)\n3ac3702361c9eee797461ccf70d69fe4a34e5f30 2026-08-24 PLAT-3347: rename internal metrics\n3a0a254387f498fe0d59c07296bba4f21fef9f6c 2026-08-22 PLAT-3128: bump grpc client to 1.64\n776d0b6bd63feea8109efd8fa6c38d146c4e5b91 2026-08-20 PLAT-3306: hand